{
  "answer": "The country that played the most matches in UEFA European Football Championships, according to the 2024 Guinness World Records, is **Germany**, with 58 matches played by the team between 1960 and 2024 (https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/90527-most-matches-played-in-uefa-european-football-championships-by-a-team).\n\nThe current President of Germany is **Frank-Walter Steinmeier** (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/President_of_Germany).\n\nHis current spouse is **Elke Büdenbender** (https://www.bundespraesident.de/EN/federal-president/elke-buedenbender/elke-buedenbender_node.html).",
